<abstract>
<gco:CharacterString>The decisions data was retrieved from the the UNHCR refugee statistics and spans from 2013 to 2023. The data provides the decision breakdown for Ukrainian applicants in European countries. The decision types are described as follows:NA - New ApplicationsFI - First instance decisionsFA - First instance and appeal</gco:CharacterString>
</abstract>
<purpose>
<gco:CharacterString>The dataset contains the number and type of decisions made on Ukrainian applicants in European countries. </gco:CharacterString>
</purpose>
